div class="flex items-center justify-center">35*</div></td><td class="py-3 pl-3 pr-4 align-middle text-xs text-neutral-500">GPT-6 Astra (low) is more intelligent than Qwen3.8 27B (medium)</td></tr><tr class="bg-neutral-50"><th scope="row" class="py-3 pl-4 pr-3 text-left align-middle text-xs">Price per 1M Tokens</th><td class="px-3 py-3 text-center align-middle text-neutral-900"><div class="flex items-center justify-center">$7.70</div></td><td class="px-3 py-3 text-center align-middle text-neutral-900"><div class="flex items-center justify-center">$0.43</div></td><td class="py-3 pl-3 pr-4 align-middle text-xs text-neutral-500">Qwen3.8 27B (medium) is cheaper than GPT-6 Astra (low)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="py-3 pl-4 pr-3 text-left align-middle text-xs">Output Speed</th><td class="px-3 py-3 text-center align-middle text-neutral-900"><div class="flex items-center justify-center">59 tokens/s</div></td><td class="px-3 py-3 text-center align-middle text-neutral-900"><div class="flex items-center justify-center">53 tokens/s</div></td><td class="py-3 pl-3 pr-4 align-middle text-xs text-neutral-500">GPT-6 Astra (low) is faster than Qwen3.8 27B (medium)</td></tr><tr class="bg-neutral-50"><th scope="row" class="py-3 pl-4 pr-3 text-left align-middle text-xs">Time to First Token</th><td class="px-3 py-3 text-center align-middle text-neutral-900"><div class="flex items-center justify-center">2.81s</div></td><td class="px-3 py-3 text-center align-middle text-neutral-900"><div class="flex items-center justify-center">3.87s</div></td><td class="py-3 pl-3 pr-4 align-middle text-xs text-neutral-500">GPT-6 Astra (low) responds faster than Qwen3.8 27B (medium)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="py-3 pl-4 pr-3 text-left align-middle text-xs">Context Window</th><td class="px-3 py-3 text-center align-middle text-neutral-900"><div class="flex items-center justify-center"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-0.5"><span>1000k tokens</span><span class="text-xs text-neutral-500">~1,500 A4 pages of size 12 Arial font</span></div></div></td><td class="px-3 py-3 text-center align-middle text-neutral-900"><div class="flex items-center justify-center"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-0.5"><span>256k tokens</span><span class="text-xs text-neutral-500">~384 A4 pages of size 12 Arial font</span></div></div></td><td class="py-3 pl-3 pr-4 align-middle text-xs text-neutral-500">GPT-6 Astra (low) has a larger context window than Qwen3.8 27B (medium)</td></tr><tr class="bg-neutral-50"><th scope="row" class="py-3 pl-4 pr-3 text-left align-middle text-xs">Release Date</th><td class="px-3 py-3 text-center align-middle text-neutral-900"><div class="flex items-center justify-center">September 2026</div></td><td class="px-3 py-3 text-center align-middle text-neutral-900"><div class="flex items-center justify-center">August 2026</div></td><td class="py-3 pl-3 pr-4 align-middle text-xs text-neutral-500">GPT-6 Astra (low) has a more recent release date than Qwen3.8 27B (medium)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="py-3 pl-4 pr-3 text-left align-middle text-xs">Reasoning</th><td class="px-3 py-3 text-center align-middle text-neutral-900"><div class="flex items-center justify-center"><span class="text-green-500" title="Yes"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">Yes</span></span></div></td><td class="px-3 py-3 text-center align-middle text-neutral-900"><div class="flex items-center justify-center"><span class="text-green-500" title="Yes"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">Yes</span></span></div></td><td class="py-3 pl-3 pr-4 align-middle text-xs text-neutral-500">Both GPT-6 Astra (low) and Qwen3.8 27B (medium) have reasoning</td></tr><tr class="bg-neutral-50"><th scope="row" class="py-3 pl-4 pr-3 text-left align-middle text-xs">Image Input Support</th><td class="px-3 py-3 text-center align-middle text-neutral-900"><div class="flex items-center justify-center"><span class="text-green-500" title="Yes"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">Yes</span></span></div></td><td class="px-3 py-3 text-center align-middle text-neutral-900"><div class="flex items-center justify-center"><span class="text-green-500" title="Yes"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">Yes</span></span></div></td><td class="py-3 pl-3 pr-4 align-middle text-xs text-neutral-500">Both GPT-6 Astra (low) and Qwen3.8 27B (medium) have image input support</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="py-3 pl-4 pr-3 text-left align-middle text-xs">Open Source (Weights)</th><td class="px-3 py-3 text-center align-middle text-neutral-900"><div class="flex items-center justify-center"><span class="text-neutral-800" title="No"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-minus h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">No</span></span></div></td><td class="px-3 py-3 text-center align-middle text-neutral-900"><div class="flex items-center justify-center"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-green-500" title="Yes"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">Yes</span></span> <a target="_blank" class="ml-2 flex items-center gap-1 text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800" href="https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a></div></div></td><td class="py-3 pl-3 pr-4 align-middle text-xs text-neutral-500">Qwen3.8 27B (medium) is open source while GPT-6 Astra (low) is proprietary</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section id="intelligence" class="scroll-mt-24"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 mb-8 pt-5 border-t"><div aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-px opacity-0 pointer-events-none"></div><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4"><h2 class="flex items-baseline gap-3 flex-wrap"><span class="w-5 h-5 bg-black" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Intelligence</span><span class="rounded-full cursor-default whitespace-nowrap font-brand-sans font-normal bg-brand-purple-dark text-white text-xs px-2 py-1 self-center" data-state="closed">Updated</span></h2></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 overflow-hidden"><div id="artificial-analysis-intelligence-index" class="scroll-mt-24 p-8 border rounded-lg"><div class="flex flex-col gap-5 mb-5"><div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 xl:gap-12"><div c